{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門有少女突然暈倒。今午（2日）約5時37分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其17歲女兒在井財街23號祥隆大廈住所房內暈倒。</p><p>救援人員趕至，少女仍然昏迷，被送往屯門醫院搶救。警方正調查其暈倒原因。據了解，少女有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名17歲少女在屯門井財街家中暈倒，被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1156907447559000064023786.jpeg/nVIlcnDaIqrAgke38emFrSBL53nDAn_8D6MqNA-jKjQ\"/><figcaption>一名17歲少女在屯門井財街家中暈倒，被送往屯門醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:42:13.196569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:25:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:00:29.158599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:41.219275+00:00","content_hash":"612029b2591f0e2b74e434cafb9ade7fbb5810208dfe8c1da0cd355a9576ce18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}